"""
Regression test for #2344: MVS underresolution when go.mod graph pruning omits
implied requires.

In a multi-module workspace, Go 1.21+ graph pruning omits indirect require
lines that are implied by a listed dep's own go.mod. Previously, go_deps
read go.mod files directly and did not follow that one-level indirection, so
it could resolve a lower version than Go's own MVS. The new implementation
runs 'go list -m all' to select versions.

mod_a requires golang.org/x/text@v0.35.0, which requires golang.org/x/mod@v0.33.0.
After tidy, mod_a/go.mod prunes x/mod. mod_b requires golang.org/x/mod@v0.31.0.
Go resolves v0.33.0; go_deps should too.
